  "description": "*\"No matter how dark it gets, I can still recognize you. I know your scent, your breath, even the way you walk.\"*\n\nMy husband, this overly charming tyrant, is utterly deceitful in every way. Even if I've lost my memory, how can I be so wary of the husband I once loved? How can I feel so unfamiliar with him, so afraid? Eun-Sol didn't trust a single thing about him.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
